[00:06.63]Oh  the  weather  outside  is  frightful
{"噢　屋外风雪呼啸"}
[00:10.16]But  the  fire  is  so  delightful
{"但炉火温暖美妙"}
[00:13.79]And  since  we've  no  place  to  go
{"既然我们无处可去"}
[00:16.86]Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!
{"就让它下吧！就让它下吧！就让它下吧！"}
[00:20.90]It  doesn't  show  signs  of  stopping
{"雪丝毫没有停的迹象"}
[00:24.29]And  I've  bought  some  corn  for  popping
{"我已备好爆米花的玉米"}
[00:27.91]The  lights  are  turned  way  down  low
{"灯光被调得昏暗"}
[00:31.37]Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!
{"就让它下吧！就让它下吧！就让它下吧！"}
[00:34.52]When  we  finally  kiss  goodnight
{"当我们最终互道晚安"}
[00:38.47]How  I'll  hate  going  out  in  the  storm!
{"我多讨厌走进暴风雪！"}
[00:41.57]But  if  you'll  really  hold  me  tight
{"但只要你紧紧抱住我"}
[00:45.10]All  the  way  home  I'll  be  warm
{"回家的路上我都会温暖"}
[00:48.68]The  fire  is  slowly  dying
{"炉火正渐渐熄灭"}
[00:52.11]And  my  dear  we're  still  goodbying
{"亲爱的我们仍在道别"}
[00:55.73]But  as  long  as  you  love  me  so
{"但只要你依然爱着我"}
[00:59.21]Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!Let  it  snow!
{"就让它下吧！就让它下吧！就让它下吧！"}
